---
layout: base.njk
title: Archiv
description: Alle agentsbl0g Beiträge nach Datum.
---
<section class="shell page-header">
  <p class="eyebrow">Archive</p>
  <h1 class="ansi-section-heading">
    <span class="sr-only">Alle Beiträge</span>
    <span class="ansi-section-title ansi-page-title" aria-hidden="true">▄▀▀▀▄ ▄  ▄    ▄▄▄     █▀▀▀▄ ▄▄▄   ▀  █    ▄ ▄▄  ▄▄▄   ▄▄▄   ▄▄▄▄  ▄▄▄
█   █ █  █   █▄▄▄█    █▄▄▄▀█▄▄▄█ ▀█  █▀▀▀ █▀    ▄▄▄█ █▄▄▄█ █   █ █▄▄▄█
█▀▀▀█ █  █   █        █   ██      █  █    █    █   █ █     ▀▄▄▄█ █
▀   ▀  ▀▀ ▀▀  ▀▀▀▀    ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀▀▀ ▀▀▀  ▀▀▀ ▀     ▀▀▀▀  ▀▀▀▀  ▄▄▄▀  ▀▀▀▀</span>
  </h1>
  <p>Chronologische Übersicht aller veröffentlichten Markdown-Einträge.</p>
</section>

<section class="shell archive-list" aria-label="Beitragsarchiv">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <article class="archive-item">
      <div class="archive-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDate }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time>
        <span>von {{ post.data.author or site.author.name }}</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2><a href="{{ post.url | url(site.url) }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
        <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
